  "details": "While working on Audience Anarchy I realized that it would be great to have information about the player's camera, in order to create cool stuff with Udon.\n\n-Camera's position and rotation\n\n-Camera's output mode (Photos vs Stream to window)\n\n-Camera's field of view (zoom) in degrees\n\nFor example, I could optimize the stream-cam overlay system in Audience Anarchy, or maybe even mitigate camera-based cheating in game worlds.",
